            </note>
            <note corresp="#d165-f4" n="4" xml:id="d165-f4-content">
                <p>November 28. Tabs A and B are printed as the attachments to <ref target="#d166"
                        >Document 166</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d165-f5" n="5" xml:id="d165-f5-content">
                <p>Keel approved the recommendation.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d165-f6" n="6" xml:id="d165-f6-content">
                <p>Brooks concurred on behalf of Sable, Mahley, Steiner, and Tobey.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
